abstract: >-
  A dependency-aware verification layer that records OpenAIRE/Alien MCP evidence,
  snapshots the corresponding OpenAIRE Graph state, detects material upstream
  changes, identifies affected downstream claims, and emits auditable proof
  obligations and verification receipts.
